# The embedded bridge is generated base64, chunked to a fixed width. There is
# nothing to read in a diff of it — `harness/bridge-assets-check.mjs` is what
# verifies it — and rendering a thousand changed lines of base64 helps no one.
# Marked `-diff` so diff viewers show "binary files differ" and stop there.
#
# The chunking is the part that matters: one string per file put ~77 K
# characters on a single line, and character-level diffing is quadratic
# (77318² ≈ 6.0e9 cells), which froze Paseo's own checkout-diff panel for this
# repository only. `-diff` is the second line of defence, for viewers that ask
# git rather than reading the file themselves.
paseo-plugin/server/bridge-assets.ts -diff linguist-generated
